2r9IsfYgI3,F5jjmdWWqG,vxr7jHOItG,2026,4563,0,11,0,0,,"We thank the reviewer for the valuable feedback. We have addressed all concerns: (1) clarified the execution sequence of dual-stage pruning in the main text, (2) reported initialization overhead in Appendix B3, and (3) provided a detailed explanation of the underlying principles explaining why the two modules synergize."
OaVHzHHddO,F5jjmdWWqG,IoF0N6HqoU,2026,3429,0,6,0,0,,"We thank the reviewer for the constructive feedback. We have addressed all three concerns: (1) corrected citation format throughout the paper, (2) added comprehensive comparison with MASt3R-based multi-view priors (Appendix C4), and (3) included comparisons with three recent 2025 SOTA methods covering compression and density control categories (Appendix B4)."
ZxwG411xVD,F5jjmdWWqG,VKNzvaEmOv,2026,3657,0,6,0,0,,"We thank the reviewer for the valuable feedback. We have addressed all concerns: (1) evaluated extremely sparse-view settings (results show limited improvements in this challenging regime), (2) provided comprehensive depth/geometry visualizations in Appendix B1, (3) reported GPU memory usage in Appendix B2, (4) corrected citation format and added missing reference, (5) updated Table 3 ablation study, and (6) evaluated VGGT as alternative prior in Appendix C3."
