1P8lyZqzC1,KiWcaQaf3n,uXKeH4m250,2026,4439,0,0,0,0,,"In summary, we clarify that Theorem 1 is an interpretive, estimable decomposition of conditional coverage difficulty (not a strict asymptotic guarantee), that SpeedCP targets a different scalar, representation-conditional setting than Xu et al. (2024) and Shahrokhi et al. (2025), that coverage is empirically robust across (lambda, gamma)."
