AmrdDFxh6p,qQuca6fbFX,xEeL5KQ1uH,2026,2256,0,0,0,0,,"We added three new real-world videos demonstrating smooth trajectories, disturbance recovery, and strong semantic grounding. We attempted to reproduce Pi0-Fast and Pi0.5, but default configs were highly unstable without extensive retuning."
XrUi8AnAie,qQuca6fbFX,TPd108MfEI,2026,4023,0,10,1,0,,"We added new results addressing all concerns. FDVLA-3B shows strong LIBERO performance (94/95/93/76), outperforming Octo/OpenVLA. Three real-world videos demonstrating smooth control and semantic grounding are provided (https://huggingface.co/spaces/fdvla/ano ). RVT-2/ARP were omitted due to incomplete real-robot pipelines, and Pi0-Fast/Pi0.5 remain unstable without full tuning. High-resolution figures will be used in the camera-ready."
